        "title": "I35:  'line up' read as the same middle, top to bottom:  the drawer's button sits in the menu beside the drawer, so their centres can't share an x.  The nav's first row is centred on the menu's height, whatever the theme (the layout measures its menu and hands the height to the nav, --ui-site-nav-bar-height):  jarvis-new's house and button 65.88 / 65.89px from the top, Star Wars' Films 64.99 / 65.00px.  So the current page's pill is 3px under the drawer's top, off the 4px grid, as the menu is 39.78px tall",
